<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<h1 style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Verdana;"><font color="#666666"><br></font></span></h1><h1 style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: Verdana;"><font color="#666666">Get Started Today!</font></span></h1>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;">{!Lead.FirstName},<br></p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Thank you again for submitting your online application to
National Funding. As your account manager I just wanted to remind you that
funds are still available for your business, and I am ready to help whenever
you’re ready to complete the application process.</span>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium; text-align: justify;"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal"><o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">National Funding is one of the nation’s must trusted
business lenders, and has been for over 15 years. But don’t take my word for
it, here are some reasons other business owners have chosen to work with
National Funding:</span>&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p><ul style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"><li><p>Financing available from $5,000 to $500,000 for qualified businesses</p></li><li><p>Funds available as soon as the next business day</p></li><li><p>Tailored financing for hundreds of industries, designed to fit your business' specific needs</p></li><li><p>Over $1 Billion lent to businesses over more than 15 years</p></li><li><p>70% approval rate with 95% customer satisfaction</p></li></ul><p class="MsoNormal">Read some of our customers’ reviews of their experience with
National Funding.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><br></p><p class="MsoNormal">Whenever your business is in need of cash or equipment,
National Funding is available to help. Give me a call or send me an email to
learn more. Hope to hear from you soon, so I can get you a quote for your
business.&nbsp;</p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"><br></p><p style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: medium;"><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Lead.OwnerFullName}</span><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; font-style: italic; font-weight: bold; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"></span><br style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><strong style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">National Funding</strong><br style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Phone:&nbsp; {!Lead.OwnerPhone}</span><br style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 16px; text-align: justify; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Email:&nbsp; {!Lead.OwnerEmail}</span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<span style="font-size: 7.5pt; color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font color="#666666" size="1" face="arial, sans-serif"><font color="#666666" size="1" face="arial, sans-serif"><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 153); font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 7.5pt;"><font color="#666666" size="1" face="arial, sans-serif"><font color="#666666" size="1" face="arial, sans-serif"><font color="#666666" size="1" face="arial, sans-serif">If you no longer wish to receive emails from&nbsp;National Funding, send an email to&nbsp;<a href="mailto:emailreply@nationalfunding.com">emailreply@nationalfunding.com</a>&nbsp;with Unsubscribe in the subject line. You may also unsubscribe by sending written notice to:&nbsp;National Funding&nbsp;Unsubscribe<br>&nbsp;9530 Towne Centre Dr., Suite 120, San Diego, CA 92121. Thank you.&nbsp;<br>National Funding&nbsp;</font></font></font></span></font></font></span><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">respects your privacy. Our commitment to your privacy is described in our Privacy Policy which is available on our Web site for your reference.&nbsp;</span><br style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="color: rgb(102, 102, 102); font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">© 2018 National Funding. &nbsp;All Rights Reserved.&nbsp;</span>]]></td>
</tr>
